; ---- r26e: memory scale. PAE paging (no long mode, IDT unchanged): bank 0 = words 0..2^27-1 mapped at G,
; window W (1 GB at G+1GB) shows bank k (k=word>>27) by rewriting 512 2MB PDEs. Frames come from E820 (boot sector, 0x600).
; Guest sees: CPUID leaf 0x4E4D00nn (nn=0xFF query, 1..31 sets mask 2^nn-1) -> reg0 mask, reg1 words, reg2 flags(b0 PAE, b1 E820), reg3 bank switches.
